# Sample Cookie File Format for Cursor Manager
# Drop your exported cookie files (.txt) into this Cookies/ folder.
# Supported formats:
# 1. Netscape HTTP Cookie File format (exported by Cookie Editor / Get cookies.txt extension)
# 2. Key=Value header format (e.g. WorkosCursorSessionToken=...; ... )
# 3. JSON format exported from developer tools

# Example:
.cursor.sh	TRUE	/	TRUE	1799999999	WorkosCursorSessionToken	user_01abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz%3A%3Asample_token_value
